; Title screen message: 256 characters, scrolled along row 19
;
; Eight lines of 32 characters, ASCII (character $7F is the copyright sign of
; the ROM font). #R$87CA prints the first 32 characters on the title screen;
; #R$88AE then shows a 32-character window that moves one character per step
; over the whole text (offsets 0 to $DF). The last 32 characters equal the first
; 32, so the scroll ends where it started. Text: "+++++ Press ENTER to Start
; +++++", the title and credit lines, and the story: guide Willy to collect all
; the items around the house before midnight so that Maria will let him get to
; his bed.
@label=TitleMessage
t$8454 DEFM "+++++ Press ENTER to Start +++++"
 $8474 DEFM "  JET-SET WILLY by Matthew Smith"
 $8494 DEFM "  ",$7F," 1984 SOFTWARE PROJECTS Ltd ."
 $84B4 DEFM " . . . .Guide Willy to collect a"
 $84D4 DEFM "ll the items around the house be"
 $84F4 DEFM "fore Midnight so Maria will let "
 $8514 DEFM "you get to your bed. . . . . . ."
 $8534 DEFM "+++++ Press ENTER to Start +++++"
